# Fallback for builds whose context is the repository root. The three service
# images use their Dockerfile-specific allow-lists instead
# (backend-go/Dockerfile.dockerignore, backend-python/..., frontend-react/...),
# which BuildKit prefers over this file; this list only keeps secrets and bulk
# out of any other root-context build (or a legacy, non-BuildKit builder).

.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
.trustagent/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
docs/archive/
